# --- Runtime / local data ---------------------------------------------------
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose (leading "/"). Without the slash these
# patterns match a directory of that name at ANY depth, and "Mods/" silently excluded
# the whole Terraria/Mods/ source folder - the mod API was missing from the repository
# and only the machine that had the files could build.
# Game settings written next to the executable
/Settings.ini
# Debug + crash output produced by Program.cs
/terraria-debug.log
/client-crashlog.txt
# Local save data if the game is ever run from the source tree
/Players/
/Worlds/
/Storage/
*.wld
*.plr
*.bak
*.old
/Mods/
*.tconfig
/banlist.txt
/serverconfig.txt
/motd.txt

